  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng explains Shark Demon’s deal: the entrance had already been destroyed, so Shark Demon needs Landscape as Before to restore it, and Tai Bai Yun Sheng uses that need to gain trust and a chance to explore.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "move_landscape_as_before"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later calls her a female attendant of Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable who cultivated earth path and water path and was skilled in defense and healing.",
      "chapters": [
        746
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-and-reputation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Eastern Sea, invaders inside Yu Lu blessed land name Vanishing Immortal Essence Dissipation Rain as an immortal killer move she was famous for. They also call her Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s second disciple, a rank eight great expert who learned that Venerable’s battlefield killer move core, kept many such moves, and created her own versions.",
      "chapters": [
        818
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-battlefield-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "move_vanishing_immortal_essence_dissipation_rain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later names her as a rank eight Gu Immortal and a disciple of Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, and notes that Yu Lu grotto-heaven dropped to become Yu Lu blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        820
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-battlefield-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan faces freezing rain frozen earth, he judges her a great expert in battlefield killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        888
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-battlefield-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After eight doors labyrinth falls, Su Bai Man names her as a disciple of Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable and treats that lineage as why the aperture can hold such moves.",
      "chapters": [
        917
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
